sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title: postal_send rally
  participant A as Session A
  participant T as postal_send Tool
  participant K as Plugin KV
  participant B as Session B

  loop bounded by rally counter
    A->>T: postal_send letter
    T->>K: increment rally count
    K-->>T: count within limit
    T->>B: steer letter
    Note right of B: reply with postal_send
    B->>T: postal_send reply
    T->>K: increment rally count
    T->>A: steer reply
  end
  Note over A,B: 30 letters per 10 minutes
